te_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773.072.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":4.7521768707483,"slideTitle":"スライド #72","id":"D0422A5C-4755-4525-897E-8338BF7BD25D","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":0.85,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","duration":4.7521768707483,"title":"シーン 72","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/New\/Application\/Documents\/参考資料\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/木のドアをノック1.mp3","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_072_隠岐奈.wav","telop":"すると、再び部屋の扉がノックされる。\n「いいぞ、入ってきなさい。」","seName":"SE: 木のドアをノック1","transitionName":"なし"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773.073.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":5.585238095238095,"slideTitle":"スライド #73","id":"B7CD9FE6-0923-4547-8461-D3A771964656","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"美鈴","seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/美鈴（困る）.png","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E7%BE%8E%E9%88%B4","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","duration":5.585238095238095,"title":"シーン 73","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_073_美鈴.wav","telop":"「学園長…、その手元の書類の控えとデビットカードを送ったのは、あなたって本当なのですか？総理大臣からの認可は？」","transitionName":"なし"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773.074.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":4.460204081632653,"slideTitle":"スライド #74","id":"CB928243-7468-463E-A942-724EE357BB63","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","duration":4.460204081632653,"title":"シーン 74","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_074_隠岐奈.wav","telop":"「えっと、それはだな…」私は、彼女の指摘に言葉が詰まる。","transitionName":"なし"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773.075.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":2.729342403628118,"slideTitle":"スライド #75","id":"19C2D099-6405-4171-A2A6-FDC6F11C310B","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"美鈴","seStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/美鈴（困る）.png","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E7%BE%8E%E9%88%B4","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","duration":2.729342403628118,"title":"シーン 75","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_075_美鈴.wav","telop":"「まさか…、認可も取らずに、独断で実行されたんですか…？」","transitionName":"なし"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773.076.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":4.095918367346939,"slideTitle":"スライド #76","id":"CFA06ACD-6034-4D2C-93FF-421CED435785","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","duration":4.095918367346939,"title":"シーン 76","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_076_隠岐奈.wav","telop":"「うぐっ。」私は、彼女の言う通りで何も言えなくなる。","transitionName":"なし"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773.077.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":5.458934240362812,"slideTitle":"スライド #77","id":"FA8E56A4-52A4-4F86-BE50-DC96B358238E","bgmVolume":0.7,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"美鈴","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E7%BE%8E%E9%88%B4","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","duration":5.458934240362812,"title":"シーン 77","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_077_美鈴.wav","telop":"「万が一の時には学園長の責任ですからね…、まったく…。ここ最近の学園長は彼に、固執しすぎじゃないですか…？」","transitionName":"なし"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773\/元女子校の日常　第18話_97165b2773.078.jpeg","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceDuration":2.8093650793650795,"slideTitle":"スライド #78","id":"09948F5F-7D8D-436E-92E2-B25A5AE18A98","bgmVolume":0.7